{
  "id": "03",
  "title": "Project Structure",
  "content": "<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1) 0%, rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05) 100%); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 24px; margin-bottom: 48px; border-radius: 8px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading);\">Gravito follows a predictable, clean directory structure. Familiar to MVC developers, yet optimized for performance and modularity. Choose from multiple architectural patterns to match your project's needs.</p></div><h2>Directory Layout (Enterprise MVC)</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">By default, Gravito scaffolds projects using the <strong>Enterprise MVC</strong> layout, suitable for most web applications:</p><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 24px 0;\"><pre style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;\"><code>my-gravito-app/\n├── config/              # Feature & Module configuration files\n│   ├── app.ts           # Core application settings\n│   ├── database.ts      # Database connection settings\n│   └── auth.ts          # Authentication & Authorization settings\n├── src/\n│   ├── Http/            # HTTP Transport Layer\n│   │   ├── Controllers/ # Controllers (Handle request logic)\n│   │   ├── Middleware/  # Middleware (Filter requests)\n│   │   └── Kernel.ts    # HTTP Kernel (Register global middleware)\n│   ├── Models/          # Data Models (Atlas ORM)\n│   ├── Services/        # Business Logic layer\n│   ├── Providers/       # Service Providers\n│   ├── Exceptions/      # Exception handling logic\n│   ├── routes.ts        # Route definitions\n│   └── bootstrap.ts     # Application bootstrapper\n├── database/            # Database-related resources\n│   ├── migrations/      # Database migrations\n│   ├── factories/       # Model factories (Test data generation)\n│   └── seeders/         # Database seeders\n├── public/              # Static assets (images, robots.txt)\n├── tests/               # Test cases (Unit & Feature)\n├── gravito.config.ts    # Project root configuration\n├── package.json\n└── tsconfig.json</code></pre></div><h2>Core Directories</h2><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"9\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"9\" y2=\"21\"></line></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">config/</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">Contains all application configuration files. Gravito encourages splitting configuration by feature into separate files to keep things organized.</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><path d=\"M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16z\"></path><polyline points=\"3.27 6.96 12 12.01 20.73 6.96\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"22.08\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">src/Http/</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">The entry point for handling web requests. <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">Controllers</code> receive input and return responses, while <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">Middleware</code> filters HTTP requests.</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M21 12c0 1.66-4 3-9 3s-9-1.34-9-3\"></path><path d=\"M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5\"></path></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">src/Models/</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">Where your Atlas (ORM) models reside. Each model typically represents a single table in your database.</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><path d=\"M12 2v20M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6\"></path></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">src/Services/</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">Business logic layer. Services encapsulate complex operations and can be reused across multiple controllers.</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4 10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1-4-10 15.3 15.3 0 0 1 4-10z\"></path></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">src/Providers/</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">Service Providers are the \"ignition points\" for Gravito apps. They bind services into the IoC Container and register middleware, event listeners, etc.</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" style=\"width: 24px; height: 24px;\"><path d=\"M10.29 3.86L1 12l9.29 8.14a1 1 0 0 0 1.42 0l9.29-8.14L11.71 3.86a1 1 0 0 0-1.42 0z\"></path><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg></div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">src/bootstrap.ts</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">The file responsible for initializing <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">PlanetCore</code> and loading the necessary Orbits.</p></div></div><h2>Request Flow</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">Understanding how requests flow through your application:</p><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3); border-radius: 8px; padding: 24px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--text-heading); margin: 0;\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center; color: #FFB800; font-weight: 700;\">Request</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">│</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">▼</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">┌─────────────────┐</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">│  Http/Kernel    │ ──▶ Global Middleware</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">└────────┬────────┘</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">│</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">▼</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">┌─────────────────┐</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">│    Router       │ ──▶ Route Matching</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">└────────┬────────┘</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">│</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">▼</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">┌─────────────────┐</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">│  Controller     │ ──▶ Request Handling</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">└────────┬────────┘</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">│</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">▼</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">┌─────────────────┐</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">│    Service      │ ──▶ Business Logic</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">└────────┬────────┘</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">│</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">▼</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">┌─────────────────┐</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">│  Repository     │ ──▶ Data Access</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 12px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 4px;\">└────────┬────────┘</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">│</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center;\">▼</div><div style=\"margin-bottom: 12px; text-align: center; color: #FFB800; font-weight: 700;\">Response</div></div></div><h2>Galaxy Architecture</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">Gravito utilizes a \"Micro-kernel + Orbits\" design pattern:</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">1</div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">PlanetCore</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">Intentionally tiny micro-kernel handling only the application lifecycle, IoC container, and Hook system.</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">2</div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Orbits</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">Features are added as pluggable modules. Need a database? Add <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">@gravito/atlas</code>. Need auth? Add <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">@gravito/sentinel</code>.</p></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><div style=\"width: 40px; height: 40px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFB800 0%, #FFD700 100%); border-radius: 8px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #000; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;\">3</div><h3 style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Pay for What You Use</h3></div><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">Your app only runs the code it actually needs, ensuring optimal performance and minimal overhead.</p></div></div><h2>Application Lifecycle</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">When you run <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace;\">gravito dev</code> or start the server:</p><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 24px 0;\"><ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: grid; gap: 16px;\"><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 6px;\"><div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #FFB800; color: #000; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\">1</div><div style=\"flex: 1;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px;\">Load Config</strong><span style=\"color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">The system reads files in <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">config/</code> and <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">gravito.config.ts</code></span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 6px;\"><div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #FFB800; color: #000; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\">2</div><div style=\"flex: 1;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px;\">Register Providers</strong><span style=\"color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">Every Service Provider's <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">register()</code> method is executed, binding services to the container</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 6px;\"><div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #FFB800; color: #000; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\">3</div><div style=\"flex: 1;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px;\">Boot Providers</strong><span style=\"color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">Every Service Provider's <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">boot()</code> method is executed once all services are registered</span></div></li><li style=\"display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 16px; padding: 16px; background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.05); border-left: 3px solid #FFB800; border-radius: 6px;\"><div style=\"flex-shrink: 0; width: 24px; height: 24px; background-color: #FFB800; color: #000; border-radius: 50%; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;\">4</div><div style=\"flex: 1;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading); display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 15px;\">Routing</strong><span style=\"color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">HTTP requests hit the <code style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Fira Code', monospace; font-size: 12px;\">Http/Kernel</code>, pass through middleware, and reach the Controller</span></div></li></ul></div><h2>Architectural Patterns</h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8;\">Gravito's strength lies in its flexibility. While Enterprise MVC is the default, you can choose different patterns:</p><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin: 24px 0;\"><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Enterprise MVC</h3><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">Default pattern suitable for most web applications. Familiar structure with clear separation of concerns.</p><div style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading);\">Best for:</strong> Traditional web apps, APIs, admin panels</p></div></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Clean Architecture</h3><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">Strict dependency rules that decouple business logic from the framework. Ideal for long-term maintainability.</p><div style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading);\">Best for:</strong> Complex domains, enterprise applications</p></div></div><div style=\"background-color: var(--surf-bg); border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle); border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px;\"><h3 style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-heading);\">Domain-Driven Design</h3><p style=\"margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7;\">Modular development suited for hyper-scale or complex domain logic. Bounded contexts and aggregates.</p><div style=\"background-color: rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.1); border-left: 4px solid #FFB800; padding: 12px; border-radius: 6px;\"><p style=\"margin: 0; color: var(--text-main); font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;\"><strong style=\"color: var(--text-heading);\">Best for:</strong> Large-scale systems, microservices</p></div></div></div>",
  "meta": {
    "lastUpdated": "2026-02-26",
    "complexity": "BASE_LEVEL",
    "category": "GETTING_STARTED"
  }
}
